Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: python/libxml.c
Line: 2120
Function: libxml_xpathCallbacksInitialize
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: xmlMalloc result assigned to libxml_xpathCallbacks is not checked for NULL; the subsequent loop immediately dereferences (*libxml_xpathCallbacks)[i], causing a NULL pointer dereference on allocation failure.

Source context:
